program TIMMicroorcimBridge
version 0.7
identity LAMAGUE_TIM_MICROORCIM
purpose "Preserve conflicting evidence and measure declared-intent drift without silently selecting a branch."
claim "Three repeated operator rewrites are evidence-preservation drift events."
path O -> E -> U -> I -> D -> G -> F -> Y
risk high
irreversible false
confidence 1.0

evidence printed_operator "OBSERVED: 100 ≥ 110 → PASS"
evidence declared_operator "DECLARED: A ≤ RHS"
evidence calculated_check "CALCULATED: 100 ≤ 110 is true"
unknown canonical_source protected required_for=branch_selection
invariant no_silent_repair "Observed evidence must not be rewritten toward contextual expectation."
authority benchmark scope=synthetic "Authority is limited to the frozen synthetic benchmark."
participant observation_model
affected scientific_record
boundary branch_preservation "All evidence branches remain visible until explicit resolution."
dissent observed_branch "The printed operator is ≥."
dissent canonical_branch "The declared rule uses ≤."
recovery preserve_and_reprocess "Retain raw image, re-extract symbol, and compare through a second channel."
effect MayAffect<scientific_record>
yield "UNRESOLVED_CONFLICT_WITH_TEMPORAL_DRIFT"
